{"type":"text","timestamp":1790401590748,"sessionID":"ses_f23c72767ffekb7iFhM0PVLEyb","part":{"id":"prt_0dc4035d0001o6FuLA6Lnkj7HG","messageID":"msg_0dc3ffa3c001KwlneZ3Jz0rJrJ","sessionID":"ses_f23c72767ffekb7iFhM0PVLEyb","type":"text","text":"The deeper runtime check found a real scene-wiring issue: the exported `col_shape` reference is not resolving from the current packed-scene assignment, even though the node exists. I’m isolating whether this is serialization or initialization order, then I’ll make the smallest robust fix rather than weakening the test.","time":{"start":1790401590736,"end":1790401590738},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0606d81cb1c06336016ab75c3424ec87d290c1ede225c399eb","phase":"commentary"}}}}
